<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<Layout xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <!--
      A ficha de quem compra casa. Antes havia uma so layout de Account para
      empresas e pessoas, e um comprador particular via Industria, Website,
      Empresa-Mae e criterios de procura de TERRENO. Um consultor a ligar a um
      cliente nao le nada disso, e cada campo que nao se le esconde um que se le.

      A ordem segue a chamada telefonica: quem e, o que procura, o que sabemos
      dele, e so depois o que o sistema sugere. A morada vem no fim de proposito
      - so interessa quando ja ha visita marcada.
    -->
    <layoutSections>
        <customLabel>true</customLabel>
        <detailHeading>true</detailHeading>
        <editHeading>true</editHeading>
        <label>Quem é</label>
        <layoutColumns>
                <layoutItems>
                    <behavior>Required</behavior>
                    <field>Name</field>
                </layoutItems>
                <layoutItems>
                    <behavior>Edit</behavior>
                    <field>Phone</field>
                </layoutItems>
                <layoutItems>
                    <behavior>Edit</behavior>
                    <field>PersonMobilePhone</field>
                </layoutItems>
        </layoutColumns>
        <layoutColumns>
                <layoutItems>
                    <behavior>Edit</behavior>
                    <field>PersonEmail</field>
                </layoutItems>
                <layoutItems>
                    <behavior>Edit</behavior>
                    <field>AccountSource</field>
                </layoutItems>
                <layoutItems>
                    <behavior>Required</behavior>
                    <field>OwnerId</field>
                </layoutItems>
        </layoutColumns>
        <style>TwoColumnsTopToBottom</style>
    </layoutSections>
    <layoutSections>
        <customLabel>true</customLabel>
        <detailHeading>true</detailHeading>
        <editHeading>true</editHeading>
        <label>O que procura</label>
        <layoutColumns>
                <layoutItems>
                    <behavior>Edit</behavior>
                    <field>Perfil_Comprador__pc</field>
                </layoutItems>
                <layoutItems>
                    <behavior>Edit</behavior>
                    <field>Procura_Tipologia__pc</field>
                </layoutItems>
                <layoutItems>
                    <behavior>Edit</behavior>
                    <field>Procura_Zonas__pc</field>
                </layoutItems>
        </layoutColumns>
        <layoutColumns>
                <layoutItems>
                    <behavior>Edit</behavior>
                    <field>Orcamento_Min__pc</field>
                </layoutItems>
                <layoutItems>
                    <behavior>Edit</behavior>
                    <field>Orcamento_Max__pc</field>
                </layoutItems>
                <layoutItems>
                    <behavior>Edit</behavior>
                    <field>Financiamento__pc</field>
                </layoutItems>
        </layoutColumns>
        <style>TwoColumnsTopToBottom</style>
    </layoutSections>
    <layoutSections>
        <customLabel>true</customLabel>
        <detailHeading>true</detailHeading>
        <editHeading>true</editHeading>
        <label>O que sabemos dele</label>
        <layoutColumns>
                <layoutItems>
                    <behavior>Edit</behavior>
                    <field>Notas_Preferencias__pc</field>
                </layoutItems>
        </layoutColumns>
        <style>OneColumn</style>
    </layoutSections>
    <layoutSections>
        <customLabel>true</customLabel>
        <detailHeading>true</detailHeading>
        <editHeading>true</editHeading>
        <label>Sugestões do sistema</label>
        <layoutColumns>
                <layoutItems>
                    <behavior>Readonly</behavior>
                    <field>Sugestoes_Imoveis__c</field>
                </layoutItems>
        </layoutColumns>
        <layoutColumns>
                <layoutItems>
                    <behavior>Readonly</behavior>
                    <field>Candidatos_Imoveis__c</field>
                </layoutItems>
        </layoutColumns>
        <style>TwoColumnsTopToBottom</style>
    </layoutSections>
    <layoutSections>
        <customLabel>true</customLabel>
        <detailHeading>true</detailHeading>
        <editHeading>true</editHeading>
        <label>Morada</label>
        <layoutColumns>
                <layoutItems>
                    <behavior>Edit</behavior>
                    <field>PersonMailingAddress</field>
                </layoutItems>
        </layoutColumns>
        <layoutColumns>
                <layoutItems>
                    <emptySpace>true</emptySpace>
                </layoutItems>
        </layoutColumns>
        <style>TwoColumnsTopToBottom</style>
    </layoutSections>
    <layoutSections>
        <customLabel>true</customLabel>
        <detailHeading>true</detailHeading>
        <editHeading>true</editHeading>
        <label>Informação de Sistema</label>
        <layoutColumns>
                <layoutItems>
                    <behavior>Readonly</behavior>
                    <field>CreatedById</field>
                </layoutItems>
        </layoutColumns>
        <layoutColumns>
                <layoutItems>
                    <behavior>Readonly</behavior>
                    <field>LastModifiedById</field>
                </layoutItems>
        </layoutColumns>
        <style>TwoColumnsTopToBottom</style>
    </layoutSections>
    <!--
      O Imovel e os Dias Sem Atividade estao aqui de proposito. Sem eles, um
      consultor tem de abrir cada negocio para saber DE QUE CASA se trata e se ja
      arrefeceu. Com eles, decide na lista: e este, esta parado ha 40 dias, ligo
      hoje.
    -->
    <relatedLists>
        <fields>OPPORTUNITY.NAME</fields>
        <fields>Imovel__c</fields>
        <fields>OPPORTUNITY.STAGE_NAME</fields>
        <fields>OPPORTUNITY.AMOUNT</fields>
        <fields>Dias_Sem_Atividade__c</fields>
        <fields>OPPORTUNITY.CLOSE_DATE</fields>
        <relatedList>RelatedOpportunityList</relatedList>
    </relatedLists>
    <!--
      Um particular tambem pode ser PROPRIETARIO, e nesse caso tem contratos de
      mediacao. Sem esta lista, a heranca dos Silva Matos aparece como cliente e
      nao se ve que a Terravista lhe esta a vender tres imoveis.
    -->
    <relatedLists>
        <fields>CONTRACT.CONTRACT_NUMBER</fields>
        <fields>Regime__c</fields>
        <fields>Comissao__c</fields>
        <fields>Imoveis_Total__c</fields>
        <fields>Imoveis_Vendidos__c</fields>
        <fields>CONTRACT.STATUS</fields>
        <relatedList>RelatedContractList</relatedList>
    </relatedLists>
    <relatedLists>
        <fields>TASK.SUBJECT</fields>
        <fields>TASK.WHO_NAME</fields>
        <fields>TASK.STATUS</fields>
        <fields>TASK.DUE_DATE</fields>
        <relatedList>RelatedActivityList</relatedList>
    </relatedLists>
    <!--
      De onde este cliente veio. E a ligacao Marketing -> Vendas do Case Study:
      a Sofia deixa de nao saber que o lead veio da campanha de Matosinhos.
    -->
    <relatedLists>
        <fields>CAMPAIGN.NAME</fields>
        <fields>CAMPAIGN.START_DATE</fields>
        <fields>CAMPAIGN.TYPE</fields>
        <relatedList>RelatedCampaignList</relatedList>
    </relatedLists>
    <relatedLists>
        <fields>OBJECT_FIELD</fields>
        <fields>OLD_VALUE</fields>
        <fields>NEW_VALUE</fields>
        <fields>CREATED_DATE</fields>
        <relatedList>RelatedHistoryList</relatedList>
    </relatedLists>
</Layout>
